                "description": "Trick or treat! The GBA Microjam '23 is a spooky microgame collection for the Game Boy Advance created by the members of the gbadev.net community. If you've played WarioWare you'll know what to expect! (If you haven't... then heck, why not download it anyway and see wha...\nSee release notes...",
                "icon_index": 47,
